Package: cal.image
Title: Calcium Imaging Analysis for Microfluidic SCN Explant Culture
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("Richard", "Ortiz",
           email = "rjortiz4@hotmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-1209-9744"))
Description: An R Shiny pipeline for analyzing calcium imaging data from
    prairie vole suprachiasmatic nucleus explants cultured on a 3D-printed
    bubble perfusion microfluidic chip. Provides trace import, interactive
    oxygen-bubble artifact removal, one-phase exponential photobleaching
    correction, and Wilcoxon rank-sum testing with Benjamini-Hochberg FDR
    correction.
